<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>SmartOddsAI</title>
<style>
body {
  font-family: Arial;
  background: #0f172a;
  color: white;
  margin: 0;
}
.header {
  background: black;
  padding: 20px;
  text-align: center;
  font-size: 24px;
  font-weight: bold;
}
.container {
  padding: 20px;
}
.card {
  background: #1e293b;
  padding: 20px;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
  border-radius: 10px;
}
.btn {
  background: gold;
  color: black;
  padding: 12px;
  text-decoration: none;
  display: inline-block;
  margin-top: 10px;
  font-weight: bold;
}
.vip {
  background: red;
  padding: 20px;
  border-radius: 10px;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="header">SmartOddsAI</div>

<div class="container">

<div class="card">
<h2>🔥 Today’s Free Tip</h2>
<p>Team A vs Team B - Over 1.5 Goals</p>
</div>

<div class="vip">
<h2>🔒 VIP Predictions</h2>
<p>Unlock premium games with high odds.</p>
<a class="btn" href">Join VIP</a>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h2>📊 Winning Proof</h2>
<p>✔ 10/12 Games Won Yesterday</p>
<p>✔ Consistent Daily Wins</p>
</div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
